# Step 21.9 (a), declaration arguments (book #declaration-arguments), row A07 with a form: refusal (answer 5): after the counter went off an unnamed position is refused, a form with an absent name is an unnamed position
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
        int: calls 0
)
fn: producer () int
    @: shared node[0]
    shared\Observed\calls := shared\Observed\calls + 1
    return: 7
@: Any ()
fn: h (@: it Any; int: y 0) int
    return: y
sub: main ()
    @: shared node[0]
    shared\Observed\seen := h(y := 4; int: item producer())
main()
